Z||000000||Cooter||03-29-2000||09:53 PM||||While out shopping (at the junk yard) I spotted a set of louvers that may look decent when added to the front hood of our cars. They are from a mid 80's 280z. The one on the right has been trimmed down a little to be better sized to our application. See what y'all think:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp00805.jpg"> ||||reg||1
