Z||000006||DJRice||03-30-2000||11:25 AM||||Those look pretty good.  I had noticed a late 80's early 90's Grand Prix GTP with some hood louvers in a parking lot the other day that I thought might be a good fit too.  Very similar to these but not quite as wide.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Cooter||03-30-2000||09:17 PM||||I evened up the front edge of the louver so it would come closer to matching the edge of the hood. I still have not finished out the rear edge yet. I will probably use a little finishing putty to give it a more closed end to match the front. The rear mounting studs were removed, so I am going to epoxy in a couple of bolts to use for mounting it. If I ever get around to finishing, I will post pic's.||||reg||1
